# shellcheck shell=bash
# shellcheck disable=SC2034 # every name here is read by a script that sources this file
# Pinned versions of every checker and test tool: scripts/dev/setup.sh installs them locally, CI reads this
# file (the static job's install-action step and scripts/ci/install-*.sh). Each is the newest release on
# 2026-11-06; bump by changing the version and, where given, the SHA-256 of the release asset.

# Nightly rustfmt (rustfmt.toml uses unstable options), Miri and the fuzz targets.
